&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Lead design strategy and execution across Coinbase One membership, CB1 Card, and the broader Loyalty surface area, spanning multiple product and engineering pods&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Partner with senior Product and Engineering leads to shape roadmaps, drive alignment, and represent design in leadership forums&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive 0-to-1 strategic design work including membership evolution, retention mechanics, and rewards experiences&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Set and maintain a high quality bar across all Loyalty surfaces through structured review processes (design crits, DRRs, workbench sessions)&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Represent Loyalty design in exec-level reviews and cross-functional leadership syncs&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
