&lt;li&gt;Collaborate with product management, engineering, and other design teams to ensure consistent implementation of design components.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Create, iterate, and refine design system components, including flows, prototypes, and high-fidelity visuals.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Drive the adoption and continuous improvement of the design system across the organization.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
