&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;5+ years of experience as a Design Systems designer&amp;nbsp;&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience working independently and collaboratively to explore design solutions from concept to implementation.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proven ability to create simple, scalable solutions for complex user experiences across multiple products.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Experience managing complex projects that involve collaboration across different teams and organizational boundaries.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Proficiency building concepts in code and using production quality concepts to communicate design decisions effectively.&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
